		{
			"id":"01d218d1a34e4db4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**rhetorical slight of hand**\nNot always. Not even usually. But sometimes.\n\nExploration and dissection of my own flaws.\n\nResponsibilities in family matters.\n\nYou can’t put all the blame on me, you’re your own person.\n\nWhen that’s not even what’s said.",
