			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"6f4f160bdc77818c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"When a system reaches a certain complexity it becomes nigh unpredictable both in what it does and in how it’s understood.\n\nBut There is a quality in that. But to try and control it..?\n\nYou can intentionally let go. Is what happened after intentional?\n\nWhen did you become so pensive?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"0ad6ce3690133914",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"How would even god know to find me?\n\nMany Aprils buried.\n\nUnderground\n\n  \n\nMakes me wish for\n\nNo more gilded Cage\n\nTurned to stone\n\n  \n\nGrave mistake\n\nNo Achieving heaven unless buried",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"42a156dbe163a309",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"only way to heaven is undergroud",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"07b591c37afb8183",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The only character allowed to make erratic decisions is the player. Everyone else must be smart people doing smart things. Even if the player isn’t.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":-120,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"c53473d89735cedc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tassen fallen, keine Tassen!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b886e9c40f1dbeb6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Misc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2420,
			"y":-760,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c499424705d4ca1d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Apocalypse did happen.\n\nPeople turn up with things to trade.\n\nShoot them immediately?\n\nSets off sequence of events where the mostly peaceful group grows resentful towards Daryl and decides to steer clear. No trade, no exchange. Further isolation. Eventually a well armed group turns up. They, too wish to trade.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"2d6fcfd594dcc94c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Everyone distrustful, selfish and rich/powerful enough to hide in bunkers and facilities left the world to those who weren’t. A utopia is born.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":-280,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"3af7d376ab7e2b7c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Cat:\nFamily themes resonate strongly\n\nConflict between mother and father very relatable\n\nSibling bond between April and June\n\nSees her as idol, frustration she can’t be the same\n\nCharacters have their own lives -> wants to feel that for them",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2820,
			"y":-400,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"b67a36c586832106",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Feedback",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2860,
			"y":-480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"035e184c1c02752c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"sequence where I put a personal want of a character versus a need of the system",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3360,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"9d37b90c4f3d84fb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"an assumption that really kind of feels wrong, but is then justified post",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3360,
			"y":-300,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"a1ae725be627cff3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"howcase the character dialogues. what they talk about and how all of it is, in a sense, a metaphor for something greater",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3360,
			"y":-200,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"f40ed3101ee1e2b2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"reinforce and teach that fear for players, how foresight and paranoia can help you maintain this status quo",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3380,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"2d7fb005718171e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Argument against existence and god**\nSimulation theory\nBest of all worlds\nLand as its own map",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":60,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"36207e19022cacf9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"First impressions / Demo notes",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3400,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"cefadcfaf7d70254",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Decompression Test (are my ideas coherent enough that it replies what i would expect to the ideas presented)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3820,
			"y":-20,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"02c8c493ecaa90a8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"First Impresssions:\nHello World in Kunei",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":-480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4fc2a617920a6fcf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"this channel is a sketchbook",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":-400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3bacef637a0c6def",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"art as trigger / prompt",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":-320,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"7d8b45ac709a97b4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Woke/bad writing in pop media\n\nEmpty progressivism \nEven arcane",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"235f4a427e63045f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Useful AI",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":-100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9cf01bc191d3bda2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Video Ideas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3900,
			"y":-560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"cf85202b2046c499",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Artist is something others should call you",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2a934e7f36b58630",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Horror - ZeitGEIST",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3820,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1ef1126998be1d85",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Focus on the feel of it",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3400,
			"y":140,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"54f7274267834571",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"cat approach:\ndont preach, instead\nBut wants to send a message\n\nHere’s me sharing what I think is beautiful",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":200,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"64737a33a13c2a60",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Finding words / concepts\n(similar to but a little more targeted than spinning a globe and seeing where your finger lands)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3820,
			"y":200,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"5bf9b4fa24faeb52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Add full books/texts of public domain works (+export func)(+april/mary-ann annotations)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":240,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"a3ccba9d1a09902c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Anarchism military proof\nMilitias: same as insurgency math",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":380,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"e7378c42dc6a337a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Project Sundial**\na theoretical 1950s top-secret Cold War concept for a doomsday nuclear weapon.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":360,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"ec4db62f7ffc1c73",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"dont worry about the first video being long working well for other channels, if you have one thats good, put it on a second channel and see if the algorythm favours it.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4300,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"19af614fa328b2d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Questions of the Day on Discord",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4300,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"48b3e3c7f83fef8b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Magical Appropriation - Babel review",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":360,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a0e40c5a84cce1c3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"His dark Materials Interpretation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":440,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0ce6c79a7ea3415f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Song\nGeneral ordering her troops but they run\nWho’s at fault?\nCowards or tyrant?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":500,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"55e5e9148d2243fe",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Believability is certainly a large part of writing but it’s not its end point\nJust bc something reasonably could happen doesn’t mean that it should or is good to have happened.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":500,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"ccb11552a6ef9d6f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Tearing the daemon away is the creative process, carving out a part of yourself, of your soul to lay bare to the world, to strike a bridge between them**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3820,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"ed42e15d48266954",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Interesting Ideas on Bluesky",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4360,
			"y":-60,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"7af2702eefc16746",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Erasure is not equality",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":660,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"948696871e40a934",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Will listen to racism but not reason",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":740,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"004e5a8c1eec819b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Major part of cult is language and bespoke words to create in group out group and isolate",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":820,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"a86f53e26bd9c66e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**atom and eve**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":940,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1fbfd5271c58f33b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"eve of atom",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":1020,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"21343e2d786da3db",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The aquaponics being a metaphor for the bunker is just another example for how things just click into one another",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":1100,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"c6196bbd46b5614f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"bist du wahnsinnig oder was?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4720,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"d090327fd784e5c4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"das ist nicht fair wie du spielst, so hat niemand lust mit dir zu spielen\nniemand",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4720,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"d8cfcb33a9801b3e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"spiel mit deinen bloeden regeln?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4720,
			"y":560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"44eac60dd9c7fc0c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"overheard kid and mom playing footie",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4760,
			"y":480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"db77c812af395377",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The goal is to create a solid framework/architecture for artists to come in and do the heavy lifting with asset creation \n\nThe vertical slice will serve both as a demonstration of direction as well as testing the capabilities of the framework (to develop it while using it)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4820,
			"y":-440,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"c279e9d86bd7ba69",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Philip Pullman",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":-260,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ed70e3f1875fed41",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Genetically Modified Skeptic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"76994808fa7bb6ea",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Teleological History",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":280,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"5b283d0149cd53ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Technological Determinism",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":360,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"964f636de767f96b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Progressivism",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":440,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"02ac95107b79e62f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sociocultural Evolution",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"808335a642f82051",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Techno-Optimism",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"854f9ed8c7b0127b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Benn Jordan",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bf435673343d7113",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Look up",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5320,
			"y":200,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"53df487555c3d8b6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clint",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b1cf5c301b8b7595",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"MBB",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4880,
			"y":-520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"72571a1d0d61bf47",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Reach out",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5260,
			"y":-520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"225945d9eabcdb28",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Weird medieval vibe in an deserted office",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5700,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"28c3cf7f0e2d0c6d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"website",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":-580,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2b2a96147a27269b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The Shadow",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2c8824230a37172d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"People constructing a bridge\nWhy not automate? Highly advanced society?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":-260,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"46feadb096d033d3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Pontifex Maximus",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"7def9da8e6b52829",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The bridge has to be built by those who wish to cross it.**\nWhy not wait for the being on the other side to build it? I thought that was the point?\n\nThey are building it, but they won’t reach us if we don’t build towards them. We can’t cross if we don’t build.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":-140,
			"width":260,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"b843ebb5a3f2607c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(Make the whole thing a metaphor for artist/audience collaboration)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":140,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"761fac978de906d9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Does it make sense to make it a bridge? Should it be an antenna or recorder of some kind instead (bc of the horn?)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":260,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"a68ce6a83568a9d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Nausicaa Warrior Gods",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5740,
			"y":400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f4a52e9a55bdcae9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"We need to retvrn",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f6d5ac68adbdb6b5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"We stretch the story using gameplay\n\nBut here, similar to games like pathologic or teenage colonist the gameplay is not tacked on or unnecessary bloat, it directly supports the core pillar(story) while making it easier to fulfill player expectations for game length.\n\nThe goal is to not have the story work despite or in parallel to the gameplay, but to be significantly enhanced by it. To weave them together so tightly one wouldn’t work without the other.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":800,
			"width":260,
			"height":480
		},
		{
			"id":"5408e8ffc75e70b5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Proprioception",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":220,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"70b08c868f859274",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Love bombing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f0898a4dcd441c83",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Walled garden symbol",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":380,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"47e6f56a7833eb12",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Is there something more perverse than plastic plants?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":1280,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"fe86ab82480ab065",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Act I",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3960,
			"y":-1160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9072b482a13764b5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- Rent transport vans, tetris furniture\n- Multiple vans per day possible\n- If you get a driver -> iwabo (they know location)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4000,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"2729e36c5f914380",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"B route in act 1 is seeking therapy\n\nSo essentially:  \nI want to sell the player on the impending apocalypse. Easiest way to, regardless of actual “cause” is to create a meta narrative reinforcing that belief. B route end is waking up at the beginning after facing the uncertainty, mirroring a game over screen. Time limit during the day suggests urgency to act (and could be complete bullshit). The further you fall behind on prepping, the more it seems to be on the news. A heartbeat sound somewhere in the far distance. The screen tinting to a shade of red over time. Things like that.\n\nYou alleviate these symptoms by working towards the bunker.\n\nOr, by seeking therapy.\n\nIn that case the secret end ends the world actually. Haha",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4000,
			"y":-860,
			"width":260,
			"height":760
		},
		{
			"id":"39920baed5ffe8a0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tell them the Truth",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3680,
			"y":-1940,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"97ed6be39f5b0034",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Grim REAPER (farm)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":1300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3067f06dd4e4a871",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Using olfactory wood cupboards as aquaponics framwork.\n\nDeveloping mould\n\nWell, wasn’t exactly purpose built for this",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":-1040,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"ccda521eba2a9c91",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Borrowed cognition\nWe’re still telling stories but have stopped trying to say anything of significance\nReminds me of the people scribbling pictures under what used to be words (me so American)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":6240,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"83ecf1a7461760fa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Tutorial = rehab**\nExtra skill points first playthrough\n(not sure what i meant by this)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":460,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"f9c146c731973f58",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**June - Egg**\nChicken egg mural\n\nEgg / non-realised trans",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":-800,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"987d7848f0395ff0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"April paints Mary-Ann as a Brooding Hen",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-840,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"444e9cd17c98e410",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"April plays DnD with the Fam",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-760,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8e6f8fcb5d761c31",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"April paints Daryl as a Dragon",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-920,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"14a2a280e97a90f3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Mechanic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-1680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"47c0c5e6ad288dd2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Harold, while straight, used moneybags’ being gay to his advantage. He gave up some part of his masculinity to save his son.\n\nWhy did he die in a care facility?\n\nWhere are your siblings? \n\nWhy only us?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2800,
			"y":-1440,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"b4c9e68298b58104",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**bombraid prelude**\n\nNuclear family\nMorale bombing\nIneffective but manly",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2800,
			"y":-1120,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"743ebbb9c2b7f01e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Everything bad happens at once\n\nWar breaks out\nDomestic terrorism\nStreet fights\nPandemic\nNuclear war threat\nNuclear testing\nDoomsday prognosis\nNatural disaster",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3080,
			"y":-1440,
			"width":260,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"8662a864d6608b89",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Choices",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3640,
			"y":-1520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"756a73bdb5ee6c68",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Give money to charity?\nHelp out brother?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3700,
			"y":-1440,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2d77445876732e82",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Backstory",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2760,
			"y":-1520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"55241d51a327fe76",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Marketing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3960,
			"y":-1040,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0f008f59139402fd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Lego movie approach\n\nMake something that people actually want to see irrespective of what you’re trying to sell.\n\n that is thematically or in target audience closely related",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3920,
			"y":-960,
			"width":260,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"ff4d747bf55eac51",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Audience of one**\nArt, encryption, who gets it and who it’s for",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":6220,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"a23924782bcf1e04",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Audience of one**\nArt, encryption, who gets it and who it’s for\n\nApril is frustrated because while Maryann doesn’t get it someone else might\n\nBut does someone else matter if they might not even exist?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"6fd95d8c26f47fbd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The Good Place",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":460,
			"y":3320,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8a78b3f9c6288955",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Ideas as brushstrokes**\nCanvas/game\n\nSee the memo for detail\n(04.05.2026 08:35)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":6360,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"b9bc553021a56ab6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Solipsism**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":6080,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"564ffcfde4244e0d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Jean Paul Sartre**\nPeople are like dice\nFree to throw ourselves in any direction\n\nCondemned to be free\n\nCan’t blame fate\nLife is the result of the choices you make",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":6160,
			"width":260,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"85c904edd2801479",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Black Lagoon",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":460,
			"y":3400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"acc1fffebb93e363",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Personal Responsibility**\nas a cult/grift mechanic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":6440,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4f001fdbe118a220",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Prosperity Gospel",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":6520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dcc204e510dcccba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This is a family, not a democracy -> avatar 3",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4515b1755b5980dc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[https://youtube.com/shorts/sYLr-3AedlU?is=swcN2LlT8uLo0K9Y](https://youtube.com/shorts/sYLr-3AedlU?is=swcN2LlT8uLo0K9Y)\n\nDaryl Maryann dynamic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":800,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"d96f453836d462a3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Eventually the sun will explode - anecdote Luis CK",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":960,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"d6f971916d0219e4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tahani and her sister\n(my birdie has a hat)\nthe good place",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":1040,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"3bfbbba1eaccaed0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Writing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":940,
			"y":400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c43572837bfa7024",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The talking pillow** \n->Breaking Bad",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3873d782d9722f7b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Ahhh.. wire (Jesse/walt) dynamic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4c73aab26acee150",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Are you going to work today?**\nSkylar, there’s rot",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ca19a238cec50985",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Quote the shining only with nuklear controller instead of a bar**\n(What the place looked like back then)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1260,
			"y":480,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"e81b8d055f8ed982",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Jean Paul Sartre**\nPeople are like dice\nFree to throw ourselves in any direction\n\nCondemned to be free\n\nCan’t blame fate\nLife is the result of the choices you make\n\nBlack Lagoon",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1260,
			"y":660,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"391632a6d25e369e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Crib, umbilical tower**\nTitan 1 nomenclature",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1900f7228d6d631f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Military Industrial Complex\nComplex of Military Industry",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bad332776faca5a1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Monumentalism in church and state",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":6480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"111537265ab8638a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Feels strange to make a big change or even start moving towards it in close proximity to others**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":6560,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"4df36b161b2105dd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"June trying to self-administer gender affirming care:\n**Feels strange to make a big change or even start moving towards it in close proximity to others**\n\nYears lost to procrastination and insecurity",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"0670b775f81c7250",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Time, finitude, waste",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":6520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f97b2923b9e06dcc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**We need to learn to listen**\nPeople talking, assuming, sticking to their script\n\nArguing with people they already agree with.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":6700,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"e263613400c9c144",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Ultrafinitism**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":6600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"d3a40ed2e79b25bb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Arbitrary gender divide in virtues.\n(would you not like a patient man more than an impatient one?)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":6680,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"b6651da28cf4f2c3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Repentant sinner**\ncommon feature in preachers and other cult/religious leaders",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":6600,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"c3eb0cea17d8cec6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Cool intro sequence**\n\nAfter act 1?\n\nPlay day 6 first (like pathological 2)?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4280,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"70193923b26cf2e6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Already at the bunker?\n\nWatch the sun go down before locking yourself in.\n\nBirds flying low.\n\nWaiting for the end? Sundown.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3960,
			"y":-1940,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"c6a1f41548a1c35c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Rushing to the bunker. Heavy storm to dead of night.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3960,
			"y":-1720,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2e2123538e1537ec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Maybe resource management doesn’t need to be that big a factor? Look at how Twd s1 handled it. Many small actions have an impact on how characters see Lee. Might this be enough?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":1420,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"1a1c4da4d4f46b67",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The only character allowed to make erratic decisions is the player. Everyone else must be smart people doing smart things. Even if the player isn’t.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":-1900,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"6a51ceea07e5b44c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Emoengine**\nCharacter expressions should remain consistent between dialogue blocks. Blocks can alter or add nuance. Certain emotional states don’t allow for certain dialogue. Test this!!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":1640,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"b9335cee4d263fcf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Have the days reflect/represent tarots from a reading foreshadowing the end?!**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4280,
			"y":-900,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"bcf77384190a7e00",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4260,
			"y":-740,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"56094022b719157b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clocks in every room!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3940,
			"y":-740,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2346cb81b1d5c8f3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Our politics don’t dictate how susceptible we are to propaganda",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":6720,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"4ef47ad0a17e73e5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Return to sims optic?**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1000,
			"y":2360,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"df664aedfef476c0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sims recreation of ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1375ff60e8409613",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[David Hockney - Portrait of Artist](https://www.myartbroker.com/artist-david-hockney/articles/david-hockney-portrait-of-an-artist-pool-with-two-figures)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3820,
			"y":760,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"3b229f1c6f8cdca7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Very common in cranks to find/come across one idea and start believing it explains everything**\n[Most arrogant science book ever written - MQTate]([https://youtu.be/fO9iRDPXvT4?is=pNz8DCK0m55hCQ2y](https://youtu.be/fO9iRDPXvT4?is=pNz8DCK0m55hCQ2y))",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":6880,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"c85714d0113d4499",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"We tend to question only once.\n(once we believe to have seen how things really are, we don't tend to challenge our new belief the same way)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":6840,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"63df380114e1ea6d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Consumption",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3860,
			"y":860,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9d180a5b6e99fbad",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"They Live",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3820,
			"y":940,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"300d8bda69b12a44",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Smarter Everyday",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5280,
			"y":-100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		}
	],
